data: {"id": "0f5be6efafb84398-thinking-layer-268", "run_id": "0f5be6efafb84398", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据集群扫描结果，发现以下异常：\n\n**异常摘要：**\n*   **异常 Pod**：`aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`\n*   **当前状态**：`Running` 但 `READY` 为 `0/1`。这通常意味着容器正在运行但未通过就绪（Readiness）探针，或者处于启动中（Startup）阶段。\n*   **异常组**：`ABNORMAL` (Pod NotReady)\n\n由于该 Pod 处于 `Running` 但 `READY` 为 `0/1` 的状态，最可能的归因类型是 `NotReadyProbeFailed`。我将获取对应的诊断手册以进行后续验证。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788807656666}

