data: {"id": "0f5be6efafb84398-thinking-parallel_evidence-1523", "run_id": "0f5be6efafb84398", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份与生命周期\n*   **实体**：`aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` (UID: `13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`)\n*   **状态**：`Phase: Running`，`ContainersReady: False`。\n*   **拓扑关系**：由 Deployment `workload` 创建，运行在 `node2`，IP `172.16.104.35`，关联 Service `workload` (ClusterIP `172.30.46.240`)。\n\n### 2. 支持“NotReady”的证据\n*   **Kubernetes 条件**：`Ready` 和 `ContainersReady` 条件均为 `False`，原因是 `containers with unready status: [app]`。\n*   **探针事件**：`kubectl events` 显示大量的 `Readiness probe failed`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788807746635, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

