data: {"id": "0f5be6efafb84398-final", "run_id": "0f5be6efafb84398", "seq": 1528, "ts_ms": 1788807772350, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` | NotReady | Pod aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l 处于 NotReady 状态，Readiness Probe 持续返回 HTTP 503 错误。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` (IP: 172.16.104.35) 处于 `Running` 但 `Ready` 为 `False`，原因 `ContainersNotReady` | 确立故障表象与实体状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` (累计 103 次) | 确认 Kubelet 判定探针失败的直接响应码 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.35:8080/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.35:8080: connect: connection refused` | 提供探针配置（/ready, 8080端口）及连接被拒的历史细节 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 资源限制 `memory`：96Mi，资源请求 `cpu`：20m，`memory`：24Mi | 排除因资源硬限制不足导致的启动失败 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | 日志模式 `dependency unavailable` (HTTP 503, `/work`) 发生 8 次，`allocated_mib` 始终为 0 | 证实应用代码层面捕获了依赖失败并返回 503 |\n| 6 | Tracing | deepflow | HTTP Flow 从 `172.16.104.55` 到 `172.16.104.35` 的 `/work` 请求持续返回 503，发生 9 次 | 从网络层确证业务接口 `/work` 不可用 |\n| 7 | Tracing | tempo | Span `GET /work` 返回 `503`，`aiops.observed_mode` 为 `readiness_fail` | 关联应用内部逻辑与 Readiness 失败的具体场景 |\n\n**证据关联说明**：\n1.  **逻辑闭环**：证据 #5 (日志) 和 #6 (Trace) 证实应用代码因“下游依赖不可用”主动返回 503，这直接导致了证据 #2 (Kubelet 事件) 中的探针失败。\n2.  **探针配置确认**：虽然 Kubelet 事件 #3 提及 `dial connection refused` (8080端口)，但日志 #5 和 Trace #6 聚焦于 `/work` 路径返回的 503。这表明探针可能配置了多个端点（如 `/ready` 和 `/work`），或者 `/ready` 依赖于 `/work` 的状态，导致当前处于“依赖不可用”而非“服务未启动”的状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n下游依赖服务不可用 → 应用代码捕获异常并返回 HTTP 503 ('dependency unavailable') → Kubelet Readiness Probe 接收非 2xx 响应 → Pod 标记为 NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为 **应用代码因下游依赖不可用而返回 HTTP 503**，导致 Kubernetes Readiness Probe 持续失败。\n\n1.  **机制已确认**：日志事实 `dependency unavailable` (fact-426f3f77bbc8) 与 Trace 事实 `GET /work` 返回 503 (fact-21c1f8197574, fact-5e6190a4e624) 互相印证，表明应用正在运行但无法处理请求，原因是其依赖的后端资源缺失。\n2.  **现象已确认**：Kubelet 事件记录证实探针因收到 503 响应而判定容器未就绪 (fact-74cfe723f3ad)，导致 Pod 处于 `NotReady` 状态 (fact-8b10fb12b55e)。\n3.  **未知部分**：具体是哪一类下游依赖（数据库、缓存或其他微服务）不可用导致 `dependency unavailable` 在输入事实中无法确定。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 88.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 88.0s (Evidence 76.7s, RCA 11.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 121.907, "metrics": {"run_id": "0f5be6efafb84398", "mttr": {"value": "2.0m", "seconds": 121.91346764564514, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 121913.46764564514, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 102640.2497291565, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 42783.66494178772, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 18878.843784332275}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19612.503051757812, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 87957.57484436035, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14323.067903518677, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

